docs {
  `POST /api/v2/onlineorder/latest`

  Get the shopper's most recent incomplete shopping cart, creating a new one if none exists.

  Required scope: `api/Write`

  Optional query parameters are disabled; enable the ones you need on the **Params** tab.
}
